flowchart TB
  input[Explicit request and supplied native ports] --> check[Clone and validate identity / paths / resources / sources]
  check --> ex[Acquire EX / assert resources / read old committed]
  ex --> mut[CAS mutating / new generation / receipt null]
  mut --> ops[Retire before / install / retire after]
  ops --> evidence[Capture original bytes / provenance / adoption]
  evidence --> issue[Issue receipt and read exact source bundle]
  issue --> commit[CAS committed / guard]
  commit --> release[Complete EX release]
  release --> handoff[Committed handoff]
  handoff --> sh[Acquire SH / exact scope generation receipt / verifyCurrent]
  sh --> callback[Reader callback / normal result]
  callback --> cleanup[Guard and complete SH release]
  cleanup --> done[Completed / normal result preserved]
  mut -. failure after saved .-> incomplete[Under EX save incomplete / receipt null]
  ops -. abort or failure .-> incomplete
  evidence -. rejected or unknown .-> incomplete
  issue -. missing evidence .-> incomplete
  commit -. guard failure .-> incomplete
  incomplete --> held[Persistence saved or unknown / package result retained]
  ex -. acquire or release failure .-> blocked[Blocked / no trusted handoff]
  release -. release failure .-> blocked
  sh -. changed or unknown .-> blocked
  cleanup -. release failure .-> result[Blocked / retain obtained normal result / no rerun]
  ports[Native store / trust / all-writer resource ownership unknown] -. supplied only .-> input
  fixture[Separate Linux fixture candidate / no normal CLI integration] -. demonstrates limited adapter contract .-> ports
